on</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Cantin</surname><given-names>C</given-names></name><name><surname>O'Connor-McCourt</surname><given-names>MD</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>Investigation of three new mouse mammary tumor cell lines as models for transforming growth factor (TGF)-beta and Neu pathway signaling studies: identification of a novel model for TGF-beta-induced epithelial-to-mesenchymal transition</article-title><source>Breast Cancer Res</source><year>2004</year><volume>6</volume><fpage>R514</fpage><lpage>530</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">15318933</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B8"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Miettinen</surname><given-names>PJ</given-names></name><name><surname>Ebner</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name><name><surname>Lopez</surname><given-names>AR</given-names></name><name><surname>Derynck</surname><given-names>R</given-names></name></person-group><article-title>TGF-beta induced transdifferentiation of mammary epithelial cells to mesenchymal cells: involvement of type I receptors</article-title><source>J Cell Biol</source><year>1994</year><volume>127</volume><fpage>2021</fpage><lpage>2036</lpage><pub-id pub-id-type="pmid">7806579</pub-id></citation></ref><ref id="B9"><citation citation-type="journal"><person-group person-group-type="author"><name><surname>Demir</surname><given-names>AY</given-names></name><name><surname>Demol</surname><given-names>H</given-names></name><name><surname>Puype</surname><given-names>M</given-names></name><name><surname>de Goeij</surname><given-names>AF</given-names></name><name><surname>Dunselman</surname><given-names>GA</given-names></name><name><surname>Herrler</surname><given-names>A</given-names></name><name><surname>Evers</surname><given-names>JL</given-names></name><name><surname>Vandekerckhove</surname><given-names>J</given-names></name><name><surname>Groothuis</surname><given-names>PG